.claude/

# Source/master video assets — build inputs only. (hero_4k.mp4 alone is ~107 MB,
# over GitHub's 100 MB hard limit, so committing these breaks pushes.)
# The encoded delivery videos under assets/video/ ARE shipped — both the WebM
# and the MP4 (Safari/iOS fallback) — so they're excepted from the mask.
*.mp4
!assets/video/*.mp4

